{"unit_id": "tag:03DV:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为Zariski覆盖（Zariski covering），使有正合序列（exact sequences）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>为某些指标集（sets）。这是可行的，依据是环空间（ringed space）上拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）的定义（见《模（Modules）》定义<REF_0001>）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n（1）的证明。设<MATH_0005>。显然，<MATH_0006>也位于正合序列（exact sequence）<MATH_0007>中。因此，<MATH_0008>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），依据是《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n（2）的证明。设<MATH_0009>。显然，<MATH_0010>也位于正合序列（exact sequence）<MATH_0011>中。因此，<MATH_0012>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），依据是《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0003>。情形<MATH_0013>类似（实际上，这确实是重言式的，因为相应的环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）一致）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖"}, {"source_term": "exact sequences", "target_term": "正合序列"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "指标集"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合序列"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合序列"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "ringed topoi", "target_term": "环拓扑斯"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖", "context": "Zariski 拓扑的覆盖，待决。"}, {"source_term": "exact sequences", "target_term": "正合序列", "context": "局部呈示序列，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "指标集", "context": "来源明确是 index sets，待决。"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环空间", "context": "源模层所在空间，待决。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "原模层的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "exact seq